## 🚀 Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/username/project.git

cd project

npm install

npm run dev
```

---

## ⚙️ Environment Variables

```env
VITE_API_KEY=YOUR_API_KEY
DATABASE_URL=YOUR_DATABASE_URL
JWT_SECRET=YOUR_SECRET
```

